metadata:
  description: "Shared code for the ᝯㄝₓ plugins, plus a few features that belong to none of them. Every other ᝯㄝₓ plugin depends on it, so Stash installs it with them.\n\nIts settings are three buttons, a number and a switch. UI Customizations... holds the options that reach every plugin or Stash's own pages: a louder Scene Tagger duration warning, right-click Paste in the Tags, Performers and Groups boxes, links opening in the same tab, counts on headings such as Tags (12), folding every plugin's settings, the ⓕ and 🖬 card counters, how many lines a dialog draws at once, whether the dialogs follow the Stash theme, and the text and background colors the plugins draw in; Set All to Default at the bottom of that dialog puts all of them back. Undo History Settings... sets how much history is kept. Maximum Log Lines Kept sets how many log lines a dialog keeps for Copy log. Case-Sensitive Matching sets where the Case-sensitive box starts in every text search. Dev Mods... holds switches for working on the plugins, and each plugin's console logging; none of them writes anything.\n\nUndo History keeps what the ᝯㄝₓ plugins write, and what you save on Stash's own pages, in this browser, so it can be undone later from Settings - Tasks or the ↶ button in the top bar. A change is undone only while its field still holds what was written, so a later edit is never overwritten. Back Up and Export saves the history with a database backup. Edits from another browser, Stash's own tasks or scripts are not recorded, and a deleted entity comes back under a new id.\n\nNothing else here writes to your library.\n\nRequires Stash 0.31.0 or newer."
